      "writtenOn": "2025-07-04T23:02:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m ok with this for the sake of catching bugs but it\u0027s fairly expensive; extra copy of blobs on Store and hashing the data on Load/Store.\n\nWhat about adding a toggle so we can enable/disable it easily when trying to catch bugs?\n\nQuestion for others: Do we have protection against loading blobs from older Dawn versions? Are toggle states merged into that check?",
      "revId": "93ea3cd765d199bede50cb56993415cc3d78a07f",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9965304e_04b8df54",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 3874508
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-07T09:22:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently Dawn version (together with adapter info, device features, and device toggles [1]) is embedded into device\u0027s cache key, which should be included in every cache key (e.g. during `CacheRequestImpl::CreateCacheKey`[2]), and the Dawn version is forced validated (in `BlobCache::ValidateCacheKey`[3], get called every time in `LoadInternal`[4] and `StoreInternal`[5]) to ensure that we don\u0027t read cache from older version.\n\nSo it is possible to add a toggle to control the hash embedding. However, I thought this toggle might be enabled by default for now, since we might want to catch the rare case of cache collapse in the field?\n\n[1]: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/Device.cpp;drc\u003d4506c7306af75e2837838068d5c0248dfc1a2632;l\u003d418\n[2]: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/CacheRequest.h;drc\u003d65e89ee3bd4c7e6d756760c07d3619d37df3e9c1;l\u003d95\n[3]: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/BlobCache.cpp;drc\u003d71161fd2b1223f835e50aa026d48069d74567a2b;l\u003d87\n[4]: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/BlobCache.cpp;drc\u003d71161fd2b1223f835e50aa026d48069d74567a2b;l\u003d59\n[5]: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/BlobCache.cpp;drc\u003d71161fd2b1223f835e50aa026d48069d74567a2b;l\u003d77",
      "parentUuid": "87adea5a_822f082a",
      "revId": "93ea3cd765d199bede50cb56993415cc3d78a07f",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
